# ╭───═══◎◎◎═══───
# 🚀 **VS Code extension delivery surfaces**
# Surfaces produced only by the VS Code extension development and packaging toolchain.
# ╰───═══◎◎◎═══───
#
# .vscode-test/ — what: downloaded VS Code instances for integration testing; produced by: the official @vscode/test-electron harness, whose downloadAndUnzipVSCode stores each instance under .vscode-test/vscode-<version>; used by: the test runner launching those instances; why ignored: hundreds of megabytes of downloaded binaries, regenerable per run.
.vscode-test/
# *.vsix — what: packaged extension archives; produced by: @vscode/vsce package; used by: Install from VSIX and the private gallery distribution; why ignored: build output published through the release lane, never committed as source.
*.vsix
